resolution: "Tests run against the TypeScript source and scripts/coverage-gate.ts is wired into release:check and CI on a Node 22 and 26 matrix."
actual_result: "npm run release:check passes end to end. The gate reports on the source with thresholds pinned at the measured floor of 93 line, 72 branch, 93 function. Negative control: a throwaway untested source file makes the gate exit 1 and name it, and it exits 0 again once removed."
close_reason: Coverage gate landed and locally verified; CI legs are unobserved until the pull request runs.
